  "interpretation": "<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99%; border-width: 1px; border-spacing: 0px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" data-cke-table-faked-selection-table=\"\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong>Concentration of IgG in IU/ml</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong>Class</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong>Level of The specific IgG</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">&lt;1.0</span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">0</span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Cilinically insignificant</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">1.0 - 2.0</span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">0-1</span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Low</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">&gt; 2.0 - 3.3</span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">1</span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Medium</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">&gt; 3.5</span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">&gt;1</span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">High</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">1. Results need to be correlated clinically.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">2. Food intolerance is IgG mediated hypersensitivity, so-called Type II and Typer III reaction. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">3. Definition and quantitative measurement of allergen-specific IgG concentrations have a great importance for diagnosis and investigation of food intolerance reactions for the selection of adequate therapy; for differentiation of some types of allergies in combination with other methods can be used to control the effectiveness of allergen-specific immunotherapy.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>",
